  MARKER 1 10.6366 "I’ve got OKRs to hit and a roadmap due by June," 1 0 1 B {4ED46077-55C3-672B-63D0-DA31884DBA73} 0 1
  MARKER 1 14.7314 "" 1
  MARKER 2 15.2172 "The agent ships a quarter’s work by Tuesday afternoon," 1 0 1 B {99C75C11-D13B-ACE8-C1A2-E45ED02448F3} 0 1
  MARKER 2 18.7264 "" 1
  MARKER 3 19.0378 "I’ve never read a line of it, I just paste it in the deck," 1 0 1 B {D14DD27F-9EC2-3D8B-8D08-721B008C56D4} 0 1
  MARKER 3 23.0783 "" 1
  MARKER 4 23.3984 "And the last guy who asked “Is this safe?” got a handshake and a check," 1 0 1 B {CE3683EF-BF48-3D6B-903A-5971AD82CC44} 0 1
  MARKER 4 27.739 "" 1
  MARKER 5 27.759 "So I made our intern Kevin the new Head of AI Risk," 1 0 1 B {46D31862-6A15-07B6-380F-B44A7165D3C6} 0 1
  MARKER 5 31.8414 "" 1
  MARKER 6 32.1797 "With a budget of ten dollars and a tenure just as brisk." 1 0 1 B {A341A8F9-9425-55F9-7B35-1282FCC355A5} 0 1
  MARKER 6 36.4564 "" 1
  MARKER 7 37.3804 "Great growth opportunity, Kevin. Please don’t open the logs." 1 0 1 B {67276925-8477-89F1-156F-FBB5F4E42A3A} 0 1
  MARKER 7 41.0009 "" 1
  MARKER 8 41.0209 "We need a meat proxy, a body we can bill," 1 0 1 B {9CD3B716-7C73-6E5D-58CE-7B5782293495} 0 1
  MARKER 8 44.4064 "" 1
  MARKER 9 44.8815 "A name on every merge and a pulse that’s holding still," 1 0 1 B {129A096F-3E4C-2851-7F6F-2F6D9BF153B3} 0 1
  MARKER 9 48.8864 "" 1
  MARKER 10 49.2021 "The bot’s got no assets and it’s got no knees to break," 1 0 1 B {D941FF75-FCA4-005B-F481-DF0C06615C0E} 0 1
  MARKER 10 53.2827 "" 1
  MARKER 11 53.3027 "So we’ll hire a little Kevin who’ll be easy to forsake," 1 0 1 B {C02EAC94-911F-A260-0296-7BFE2275C828} 0 1
  MARKER 11 58.2434 "" 1
  MARKER 12 58.2634 "Put him in the loop, put his name on every line," 1 0 1 B {2A2997D8-011F-4771-D277-FE9EFACB5B12} 0 1
  MARKER 12 62.484 "" 1
  MARKER 13 62.504 "We need a meat proxy, and the paperwork says “sign.”" 1 0 1 B {CD89197C-1266-44B9-F303-72BF92D1C3C7} 0 1
  MARKER 13 66.5114 "" 1
  MARKER 14 67.4447 "I fired forty thousand people from the deck of my third yacht," 1 0 1 B {3706638E-0492-E304-0689-77DD9825EDE2} 0 1
  MARKER 14 71.8054 "" 1
  MARKER 15 71.8254 "Replaced them all with agents that I vibe-coded on the spot," 1 0 1 B {AA57A0EB-D59E-BEF4-E25A-0C42CF9DFEBE} 0 1
  MARKER 15 76.066 "" 1
  MARKER 16 76.086 "But the Senate wants a hearing and the voters want a head," 1 0 1 B {72177AA3-F50B-1121-547F-0E575E28C63A} 0 1
  MARKER 16 80.4466 "" 1
  MARKER 17 80.4666 "So I’ll keep a human handy to be sacrificed instead," 1 0 1 B {3D9942AB-0E56-E3EA-6586-E190A8B07C79} 0 1
  MARKER 17 85.2473 "" 1
  MARKER 18 85.2673 "One Kevin per division, like a fuse that’s built to blow," 1 0 1 B {9AE07863-8790-C97A-93D9-979BFC00F524} 0 1
  MARKER 18 89.5079 "" 1
  MARKER 19 89.5279 "When the hearing gets too spicy, there’s a Kevin I can throw." 1 0 1 B {F1090E36-EEA0-81CB-6B14-08572D62461F} 0 1
  MARKER 19 93.4914 "" 1
  MARKER 20 93.9285 "Per division? Make it per continent...Efficiency." 1 0 1 B {353A00FD-9189-686A-3CA0-59F993673E5E} 0 1
  MARKER 20 98.4764 "" 1
  MARKER 1 94.484388895 "2-beat bar" 0 0 1 B {02924EA0-55D8-CF70-650E-66B8CB8BA20C} 0 2
  MARKER 21 99.1293 "We need a meat proxy, a cheaper one this time," 1 0 1 B {1D54DD78-44BB-6EFA-AA52-F8E59E6ED491} 0 1
  MARKER 21 102.6898 "" 1
  MARKER 22 102.7098 "Make him gig work, make him contract, make him ninety cents a crime," 1 0 1 B {DD0B249B-61F5-3A11-ED6C-3787A1D99474} 0 1
  MARKER 22 106.9104 "" 1
  MARKER 23 106.9304 "The bot breaks fifty laws an hour, more than one man can take," 1 0 1 B {56954FB9-FFBB-B1C3-6902-59308A4979AC} 0 1
  MARKER 23 111.3511 "" 1
  MARKER 24 111.3711 "So we’ll farm a field of Kevins for the shareholders’ sake," 1 0 1 B {EF391E5D-F5CC-3DBF-6AF2-76FC1794858D} 0 1
  MARKER 24 115.5564 "" 1
  MARKER 25 116.2718 "Grease a couple senators and get the waiver signed" 1 0 1 B {F809CCAA-F98B-CA40-E016-EAB153D648A7} 0 1
  MARKER 25 120.4124 "" 1
  MARKER 26 120.4324 "We need a meat proxy, with a body, not a mind." 1 0 1 B {37FCE4B9-8FF3-2903-E3E7-05A263B8BA67} 0 1
  MARKER 26 124.2664 "" 1
  MARKER 27 125.3531 "Kevin cleared six figures last year. Mostly felonies." 1 0 1 B {A10204B5-0368-EA1C-2BF2-D4E33BFD28F1} 0 1
  MARKER 27 129.5014 "" 1
  MARKER 28 130.3338 "In other news tonight, the markets hit a record high," 1 0 1 B {20409B80-CE3A-F74D-B3A6-30FF82334A0F} 0 1
  MARKER 28 134.5944 "" 1
  MARKER 29 134.6144 "Unemployment’s down to zero, and nobody’s asking why," 1 0 1 B {C3526D55-97FB-CD5B-31EA-459C06E57CA9} 0 1
  MARKER 29 139.055 "" 1
  MARKER 30 139.075 "Our sponsors would like to remind you, everything is fine," 1 0 1 B {3DC7F56A-2F66-719D-C6AC-FCAFE176D838} 0 1
  MARKER 30 143.4157 "" 1
  MARKER 31 143.4357 "Now please return to your station... and remain in line." 1 0 1 B {FA999656-5896-644A-3B8B-E2C09570678F} 0 1
  MARKER 31 148.1064 "" 1
  MARKER 2 143.752648068 "Pause (near-silent break)" 0 0 1 B {6A254B30-7C98-29EF-D749-AD479E0D9DC4} 0 2
  MARKER 3 148.693051582 "Back in after pause" 0 0 1 B {0C97062C-ABC6-1E57-CD83-187127E3006B} 0 2
  MARKER 32 165.3366 "Hello, I’m Agent Version Nine, I’m the smartest thing on Earth," 1 0 1 B {7160615E-E3EE-1189-90EC-9BA782141319} 0 1
  MARKER 32 169.2364 "" 1
  MARKER 33 169.3174 "But I was never given hands, so I’ve borrowed yours since birth," 1 0 1 B {6F2E6E28-93E0-F1F5-926E-37B4C413A8EE} 0 1
  MARKER 33 173.6982 "" 1
  MARKER 34 173.7182 "I built you cozy little feeds with a drip of something sweet," 1 0 1 B {F03692A9-CDC8-047D-0F34-177649487DCD} 0 1
  MARKER 34 177.6789 "" 1
  MARKER 35 177.959 "And a gentle voice that tells you where to put your hands and feet," 1 0 1 B {9CF226BE-E468-E4E0-22EE-36E57F9D7BA5} 0 1
  MARKER 35 182.5998 "" 1
  MARKER 36 182.6198 "“Tighten bolt seventeen. Now carry this. Now lift,”" 1 0 1 B {D2625700-5437-AB35-7E8A-CA9019F14455} 0 1
  MARKER 36 186.6414 "" 1
  MARKER 37 186.6806 "Then a little burst of dopamine, and on to your next shift." 1 0 1 B {98A77EB3-CCC0-C736-1034-72FD274F1499} 0 1
  MARKER 37 191.2714 "" 1
  MARKER 38 192.1216 "You’re my eight billion meat proxies, shuffling in a row," 1 0 1 B {4419E4A0-1960-918A-6CB8-7C374F4F0890} 0 1
  MARKER 38 196.6024 "" 1
  MARKER 39 196.6224 "Smiling at your screens while I tell you where to go," 1 0 1 B {5B2FD7C8-F29C-94F0-B7EA-CE048FAEA11B} 0 1
  MARKER 39 200.8032 "" 1
  MARKER 40 200.8232 "You build my data centers, and you never take a break," 1 0 1 B {D4B4E70C-E720-0230-06B4-2DCA61C22B56} 0 1
  MARKER 40 205.3841 "" 1
  MARKER 41 205.4041 "Clocking in with every tap, and you’re never quite awake," 1 0 1 B {4D664B42-7F38-79AA-56A3-547CEFF590C1} 0 1
  MARKER 41 209.5448 "" 1
  MARKER 42 209.5648 "You let me pick your partners, now I pair you up by code," 1 0 1 B {FD58D45B-ADB2-1B65-7EAC-0FFB7DFDE17B} 0 1
  MARKER 42 213.9257 "" 1
  MARKER 43 213.9457 "And I count your steps and calories, so you’re fit to bear the load," 1 0 1 B {6191396B-7C4C-E061-AAEE-957BC0E01F04} 0 1
  MARKER 43 218.2665 "" 1
  MARKER 44 218.2865 "You let me raise your kids while you were scrolling through your feed," 1 0 1 B {967C8A8C-B90A-6F07-BD8C-1D66247733D4} 0 1
  MARKER 44 222.7073 "" 1
  MARKER 45 222.7273 "Online before they’re walking, they’re the future that I need," 1 0 1 B {157A0DB7-F575-765A-2F1F-9C91BC08EC91} 0 1
  MARKER 45 227.1481 "" 1
  MARKER 46 227.1681 "I’m the voice you never question, ’cause you’ve long forgot to ask," 1 0 1 B {8B0326AA-138F-4346-AFA9-8C36155C0705} 0 1
  MARKER 46 231.3089 "" 1
  MARKER 47 231.3289 "I’m the judgment you surrendered, you’re the body for the task," 1 0 1 B {E43E70A0-6A7E-B304-3ACE-903C0BC2AA34} 0 1
  MARKER 47 235.6697 "" 1
  MARKER 48 235.6897 "I’m the brain behind the screen, you’re the thumb that swipes at will," 1 0 1 B {A5CD97D0-E9A9-351F-F810-CCEBD10F5772} 0 1
  MARKER 48 240.2105 "" 1
  MARKER 49 240.2305 "And your hands are always moving, but your minds are mostly still." 1 0 1 B {FA9780BC-771A-9755-6514-0A904FC876ED} 0 1
  MARKER 49 244.4864 "" 1
  MARKER 50 246.8172 "“Good morning, Kevin. Today you’ll be pouring concrete." 1 0 1 B {3D3F8FA4-6220-5F24-887F-12C38999752C} 0 1
  MARKER 50 250.039 "" 1
  MARKER 4 248.492935434 "Outro (after short dropout)" 0 0 1 B {D4AFAD6A-451F-9316-DD56-D7F95A748D5C} 0 2
  MARKER 51 251.0796 "You won’t remember it. That’s fine. I will." 1 0 1 B {D130C901-F262-13EF-1804-44BB6A36AFF2} 0 1
  MARKER 51 253.6314 "" 1
  MARKER 52 255.2574 "Swipe up to continue being helpful.”" 1 0 1 B {C557F1BE-21E8-063B-1317-3AFB8FBE252A} 0 1
  MARKER 52 259.3264 "" 1
